ew/_img/e906266053bdd855.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/e906266053bdd855.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/e906266053bdd855.webp 720w","r2ljtpgyl0oak8tex747tvtli","Regan跨境解析广告ACOS下降但利润未增的原因及五步排查法","Regan跨境指出ACOS仅反映广告花费与归因销售额的比例，不能单独代表盈利改善。文章列举了销售规模缩小、单件利润变薄、低毛利SKU占比增加等4种常见情况，并建议通过对齐观察期、拆分利润变化、按ASIN分类、重算盈亏平衡目标及验收经营结果这5个步骤进行复盘。",{"_102":508},"2026-10-21T18:56:00.000Z","2026-10-22T10:08:24.804Z",[99,100,130],{"_95":507,"_97":166},[656],{"_114":115,"_116":657,"_118":658,"_120":659,"_122":-5,"_124":-5,"_125":-5,"_126":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/a41936e05a1c403b.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/a41936e05a1c403b.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/a41936e05a1c403b.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/a41936e05a1c403b.webp 720w","all","tag","topic","q","tab","time","order","original","collectedSince",{"_670":671},"changelogVersion","2026-10-09T22:08"]
